th 000 and 111, the recurrence might be a_n = a_{n-1} + a_{n-2} + a_{n-3} - something? Let's just do DP with states.\n\nWe'll compute number of strings of length n that end with last two bits pattern. We'll maintain counts for each state. For n=1, we can't define last two bits. So we can start at n=2.\n\nLet's compute base for n=2: All 4 strings of length 2 are allowed: 00,01,10,11. So counts:\n\nstate00: 1 (00)\nstate01: 1 (01)\nstate10: 1 (10)\nstate11: 1 (11)\n\nNow for each subsequent bit, we transition:\n\nFrom state00 (last two bits 00): we cannot add 0 (would create 000). So only add 1, resulting in new last two bits: 01 (since last two bits become 0 (previous second last) and new bit 1). Wait careful: If we have last two bits 00, and we add bit 1, the new last two bits are 01 (the previous last bit 0 and new bit 1). So transition: state00 -> state01 with +1.\n\nFrom state01 ("}}],"created":1790941081,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":3713,"total_tokens":4481,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-UnPGVk5wcVCQTkkPcqzEu6UPygwZ7gy7","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":3713,"prompt_ms":473.027,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12739752221922973,"prompt_per_second":7849.446226113942,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2396.644,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.1246988265971316,"predicted_per_second":320.03084312897533}}